    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's joint research program with a French public AI research laboratory will enable our company's to provide cutting-edge retrieval-augmented generation and explainability capabilities. our company's available capacity includes a dedicated team with a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, ensuring that our company's can deliver the project efficiently while maintaining high standards of quality and security. our company's governance practices, including a joint steering committee and operational committee, will provide a clear escalation path and ensure that all stakeholders are engaged and informed throughout the project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining our company's Our flagship product, Atelier platform, agile project management methodology, consortium partners, available capacity, and robust governance practices, our company's can provide a comprehensive AI assistance solution for The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) that meets The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) requirements while maintaining decision traceability. our company's approach will enable The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) to improve staff efficiency, enhance quality and safety of care, and achieve The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) goals as part of the 'Ségur du Numérique en Santé' program." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a response time below 2 seconds for common queries, API integration with the hospital's existing information systems (SIH) and user directories, hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by SecNumCloud within the EU, and no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with electronic patient records (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR), and provide a high level of answer relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response time below 2 seconds for common queries: FULLY COVERED  our platform's performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds, with common single-document queries being below 2 seconds at p95." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the hospital's existing information systems (SIH) and user directories: FULLY COVERED  our have standard connectors for SIH and DPI integration, as well as support for API type interfaces and integration with user directories like LDAP and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by SecNumCloud within the EU: FULLY COVERED  our hosting options include the Sovereign HDS tier on OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and located within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers: FULLY COVERED  our can offer a fully sovereign European open-weight model hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, ensuring no dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
