    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Project Coordinator Agent for our company's, the Project Coordinator Agent for Faber IA can assure that our company's has a strong foundation to meet The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) requirements. our company's flagship product, Atelier, is a sovereign platform that can forge document-grounded AI assistants from The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) own documents, providing staff with reliable and up-to-date information." ;
