    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure decision traceability, our company's will implement our company's hybrid delivery model, which combines agile iterations with a phase-gate structure. our hybrid delivery model, which combines agile iterations with a phase-gate structure has been successfully used in our company's past public sector references, such as the regional council and mutual health insurer projects. our company's project management methodology includes formal reviews and go/no-go decisions at each phase gate, guaranteeing that all stakeholders are aligned and informed throughout the project. our company's will also leverage our company's consortium partners, including OuraneCloud for hosting on a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure and Ligeo Santé for Health-IT integration, to ensure seamless integration with The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) existing systems, such as the SIH and DPI." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

